{"title": "Zee5 Removes Diljit Dosanjh's 'Satluj' from Streaming Platform", "summary": "The streaming platform Zee5 has removed Diljit Dosanjh's film 'Satluj' just two days after its release, citing unspecified reasons. The film was released on July 3, 2026, and became unavailable on the platform on Sunday. The move has sparked controversy among fans of the actor.", "summary_points": ["Zee5 removed Diljit Dosanjh's film 'Satluj' from its streaming platform just two days after its release.", "The film was released on July 3, 2026, and became unavailable on Zee5 on Sunday.", "The reasons for the removal are not specified by Zee5.", "The move has sparked controversy among fans of Diljit Dosanjh.", "The incident raises questions about content moderation and platform policies."], "title_hi": "जी5 ने दिलजीत दोसांझ की 'सतलुज' को स्ट्रीमिंग प्लेटफॉर्म से हटा दिया", "summary_hi": "जी5 ने दिलजीत दोसांझ की फिल्म 'सतलुज' को अपने स्ट्रीमिंग प्लेटफॉर्म से हटा दिया है, जिसे 3 जुलाई, 2026 को रिलीज़ किया गया था। इस फिल्म को सunday को जी5 पर उपलब्ध नहीं रखा गया।", "summary_points_hi": ["जी5 ने दिलजीत दोसांझ की फिल्म 'सतलुज' को अपने स्ट्रीमिंग प्लेटफॉर्म से हटा दिया है।", "इस फिल्म को 3 जुलाई, 2026 को रिलीज़ किया गया था। इसे sunday को जी5 पर उपलब्ध नहीं रखा गया।", "जी5 ने इस फिल्म को हटाने के पीछे कोई विशिष्ट कारण नहीं बताया है।", "इस घटना से दिलजीत दोसांझ के प्रशंसकों में विवाद हुआ है।", "इस घटना ने सामग्री मॉडरेशन और प्लेटफॉर्म नीतियों पर सवाल उठाए हैं।"], "framing": {"left": "Left-leaning outlets collectively emphasize the controversy surrounding the film's removal, highlighting the potential impact on Diljit Dosanjh's career. They also note that Zee5's decision may be seen as a form of censorship.", "center": "Centrist coverage frames the story as a technical issue with the streaming platform, focusing on the reasons behind the film's removal and the implications for users. They avoid taking a stance on the controversy surrounding the film.", "right": "Right-leaning outlets focus 